  "contentHtml": "<div><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">대류를 라면끓일 때 거품이 모이는 부분으로 많이 설명합니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">모든 국, 찌개 마찬가지인지라 거품 걷어내기가 편한데욤.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">만약에.. 가스렌지 불이 원형이 아니라면 어떤 결과가 나타날지 궁금했습니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">종이컵에 물 넣고 가운데만 가열해서 알아보고자 남편한테 토치 꺼내달랬다가 거부당했는데, 남편 왈. 냄비바닥의 불뿐 아니라 옆면에서도 영향을 받지 않을까? 이럽니다. 띠용~~</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">음.. 그 가능성 때문에 애들한테 질문하는 건 접기로 했습니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">그래도, 여러분의 생각도 들어보고 싶어서리..^^</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">만약 열공급이 바닥에서 십자로 된다면? 또는 바닥 가운데서만 강한 열공급이 된다면 거품이 배치가 달라질까요?</span><br></div><div><br></div><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2119DE34541595C332\" class=\"txc-image\"  id=\"A_2119DE34541595C332EACF\"/></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
